{#
  The health sheet (specifications.md §44). Sixty fields, so the form is cut
  into collapsible sections rather than into pages: ONE form, one submit, so
  a family that fills in half of it and saves loses nothing — which several
  pages would not give them.

  Every field is optional and nothing here can be refused, so there is no
  error state to draw. The only messages this screen shows are the flash
  from a save or a clear.

  Nothing on this page says « Desk », « année de membre » or any other word
  from the inside of the site: it is read by parents.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Fiche santé individuelle — {{ site_name }}{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
{#
  The select of `partials/form_field.html.twig` selects the option whose own
  `selected` is true and ignores `value`: an answer saved earlier was never
  shown again, the page reopened on « Non précisé », and the next save would
  have overwritten it. Every choice below is therefore handed its options with
  the saved one marked (`|map`), the same way, in one expression.
#}
{% set yes_no_options = [
    { value: '', label: 'Non précisé' },
    { value: 'yes', label: 'Oui' },
    { value: 'no', label: 'Non' },
] %}
{% set swimming_options = [
    { value: '', label: 'Non précisé' },
    { value: 'very_good', label: 'Très bien' },
    { value: 'good', label: 'Bien' },
    { value: 'fair', label: 'Moyennement bien' },
    { value: 'poor', label: 'Difficilement' },
    { value: 'not_at_all', label: 'Pas du tout' },
] %}
<div class="page-medium">
    {% include 'partials/page_header.html.twig' with {
        title: 'Fiche santé individuelle',
        subtitle: member|display_name,
    } only %}

    <p>
        Ces informations permettent de remplir la fiche santé officielle de la fédération.
        Tout est facultatif : remplissez ce que vous voulez, quand vous voulez.
        {#
          The form's own two general instructions, word for word. The second
          is a reminder about the FINAL document: it does not make any field
          mandatory here — a partial draft stays saveable.
        #}
        À compléter par les parents, représentant légal ou membre majeur au début de chaque année scoute, avant le camp, la formation et le début des activités scoutes.
        Merci de fournir des informations complètes, exactes et à jour.
        {% if last_used_at %}
            <span class="d-block small text-body-secondary">
                Dernière mise à jour le {{ last_used_at|date_fr }}.
            </span>
        {% endif %}
    </p>

    <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">
        Le document imprimé n'a aucune valeur tant qu'il n'est pas signé à la main.
        Seule la version signée et remise à l'animateur compte.
    </div>

    {% if document_error %}
        <div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">{{ document_error }}</div>
    {% endif %}

    {#
      What will NOT fit on the federation's form, said here and not
      discovered on paper. The document stays downloadable — what fits is
      written, nothing is cut in silence — so this warns rather than blocks:
      a family whose allergy list runs long still needs their form, and they
      are the ones who know what can be shortened.
    #}
    {% if overflowing is not empty %}
        <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">
            <p class="mb-1">
                Le formulaire officiel ne réserve que quelques lignes imprimées à certaines réponses.
                Ce que vous avez écrit ici ne tiendra pas entièrement sur le document :
            </p>
            <ul class="mb-1">
                {#
                  Already French sentences when they get here: the
                  controller resolves each name through
                  `HealthSheet::LABELS`, precisely so this loop can never
                  print an internal field name to a parent.
                #}
                {% for label in overflowing %}
                    <li>{{ label }}</li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
            <p class="mb-0">
                Raccourcissez ces réponses, ou joignez une feuille séparée à la fiche imprimée.
            </p>
        </div>
    {% endif %}

    <form method="post" action="/members/{{ member.memberYearId }}/fiche-sante">
        {{ csrf_field()|raw }}

        <div class="accordion mb-3" id="health-sheet-sections">

            {# --- Identité : read-only, and not stored by this module ---
               The ten lines the document will print, read from the very source
               the PDF reads (HealthSheetFilling::identity()), so what a parent
               checks here is what comes out on paper: the legal name, never
               the totem; the first address that carries a street; the mobile
               before the landline. #}
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#section-identity" aria-expanded="true"
                            aria-controls="section-identity">
                        Identité de la personne
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="section-identity" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                     data-bs-parent="#health-sheet-sections">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        <p class="small text-body-secondary">
                            Non modifiable ici. Ces informations viennent de votre inscription à la
                            fédération et sont reportées telles quelles sur le document imprimé. Pour
                            les corriger, prévenez votre animateur.
                        </p>
                        <dl class="row mb-0">
                            {% for line in identity %}
                                <dt class="col-sm-4">{{ line.label }}</dt>
                                <dd class="col-sm-8">{% if line.value != '' %}{{ line.value }}{% else %}<span class="text-body-secondary">—</span>{% endif %}</dd>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </dl>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# --- Two emergency contacts --- #}
            {% for n in [1, 2] %}
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#section-contact{{ n }}" aria-expanded="false"
                            aria-controls="section-contact{{ n }}">
                        Personnes à contacter en cas d'urgence ({{ n }})
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="section-contact{{ n }}" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                     data-bs-parent="#health-sheet-sections">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'contact' ~ n ~ '-name', field_name: 'contact' ~ n ~ '_name',
                            label: 'Nom et prénom :', value: sheet['contact' ~ n ~ '_name'],
                            autocomplete: 'off',
                        } only %}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'contact' ~ n ~ '-relationship',
                            field_name: 'contact' ~ n ~ '_relationship',
                            label: 'Lien de parenté :', value: sheet['contact' ~ n ~ '_relationship'],
                        } only %}
                        <div class="row g-3">
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'contact' ~ n ~ '-phone', field_name: 'contact' ~ n ~ '_phone',
                                    type: 'tel', label: 'Tél. / GSM :', value: sheet['contact' ~ n ~ '_phone'],
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'contact' ~ n ~ '-email', field_name: 'contact' ~ n ~ '_email',
                                    type: 'email', label: 'Email :', value: sheet['contact' ~ n ~ '_email'],
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'contact' ~ n ~ '-note', field_name: 'contact' ~ n ~ '_note',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 2, label: 'Remarque :',
                            value: sheet['contact' ~ n ~ '_note'],
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}

            {# --- Family doctor: Nom, Prénom, Tél. / GSM, the form's own order --- #}
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#section-doctor" aria-expanded="false"
                            aria-controls="section-doctor">
                        Coordonnées du médecin traitant
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="section-doctor" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                     data-bs-parent="#health-sheet-sections">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        <div class="row g-3">
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'doctor-last-name', field_name: 'doctor_last_name',
                                    label: 'Nom :', value: sheet.doctor_last_name,
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'doctor-first-name', field_name: 'doctor_first_name',
                                    label: 'Prénom :', value: sheet.doctor_first_name,
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'doctor-phone', field_name: 'doctor_phone',
                            type: 'tel', label: 'Tél. / GSM :', value: sheet.doctor_phone,
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# --- Health ---
               The federation's questions, word for word (2026 version). Three
               of them are OUI / NON / non précisé on screen — allergies,
               médicaments, régime alimentaire — and the boxes that depend on
               them carry `data-reveal-when="name=yes"`: health-sheet.js hides
               them unless that answer is chosen. WITHOUT the script every box
               stays visible, and the SERVER decides what is exported from the
               saved choices, whatever the browser showed (HealthSheetFilling).
               Hiding never erases: a text typed before a NON is still there
               when the answer goes back to OUI. #}
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#section-health" aria-expanded="false"
                            aria-controls="section-health">
                        Informations confidentielles concernant la santé de la personne
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="section-health" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                     data-bs-parent="#health-sheet-sections">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        <div class="row g-3">
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'height', field_name: 'height',
                                    label: 'Taille :', value: sheet.height,
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'weight', field_name: 'weight',
                                    label: 'Poids :', value: sheet.weight,
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        {#
                          A pair of squares on the printed form and nothing
                          else, so the screen offers the same three answers the
                          paper does — including « Non précisé », which leaves
                          both squares blank. « Précisez : » stays available
                          after NON, to explain a restriction, and is printed.
                        #}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'participation', field_name: 'participation',
                            type: 'select',
                            label: 'La personne peut-elle participer aux activités proposées ? (Sport, excursions, jeux, baignade…) ?',
                            value: sheet.participation,
                            options: yes_no_options|map(option => option|merge({ selected: option.value == sheet.participation })),
                        } only %}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'participation-details', field_name: 'participation_details',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 2, label: 'Précisez :',
                            value: sheet.participation_details,
                        } only %}

                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'swimming-level', field_name: 'swimming_level',
                            type: 'select', label: 'La personne sait-elle nager ?',
                            value: sheet.swimming_level,
                            options: swimming_options|map(option => option|merge({ selected: option.value == sheet.swimming_level })),
                        } only %}

                        <fieldset class="mb-3">
                            <legend class="form-label">La personne présente-t-elle, de manière permanente ou régulière&nbsp;:</legend>
                            <div class="row g-2">
                                {% for condition in conditions %}
                                <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="conditions[]"
                                               id="condition-{{ condition }}" value="{{ condition }}"
                                               {{ sheet.conditions[condition] ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                                        <label class="form-check-label tap-target" for="condition-{{ condition }}">
                                            {#
                                              The federation's own wording, in
                                              its own order. A label invented
                                              here would offer a parent a box
                                              the printed form does not have.
                                            #}
                                            {{ {
                                                'diabetes': 'Diabète',
                                                'car_sickness': 'Mal des transports',
                                                'heart_condition': 'Affection cardiaque',
                                                'mental_disability': 'Handicap mental',
                                                'asthma': 'Asthme',
                                                'rheumatism': 'Rhumatisme',
                                                'skin_condition': 'Affection cutanée',
                                                'motor_disability': 'Handicap moteur',
                                                'epilepsy': 'Épilepsie',
                                                'bedwetting': 'Énurésie nocturne',
                                                'sleepwalking': 'Somnambulisme',
                                                'headaches': 'Maux de tête / migraines',
                                            }[condition] }}
                                        </label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </div>
                        </fieldset>

                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'conditions-details', field_name: 'conditions_details',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 3,
                            label: 'Si une case est cochée, précisez la fréquence, la gravité et les mesures à prévoir :',
                            value: sheet.conditions_details,
                        } only %}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'illnesses', field_name: 'illnesses_and_operations',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 3,
                            label: 'Indiquez les maladies importantes ou opérations subies (appendicite, rougeole…) avec l\'année :',
                            value: sheet.illnesses_and_operations,
                        } only %}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'useful-information', field_name: 'useful_information',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 3,
                            label: 'Mentionnez toute information utile au bon déroulement des activités ou du camp (sommeil, lunettes, etc.) :',
                            value: sheet.useful_information,
                        } only %}

                        <h3 class="h6 mt-4">Vaccination contre le tétanos</h3>
                        <div class="row g-3">
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'tetanus', field_name: 'tetanus_vaccinated',
                                    type: 'select',
                                    label: 'La personne est-elle en ordre ?',
                                    value: sheet.tetanus_vaccinated,
                                    options: yes_no_options|map(option => option|merge({ selected: option.value == sheet.tetanus_vaccinated })),
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {# Stays available whatever the answer above: the date is printed as entered. #}
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'tetanus-booster', field_name: 'tetanus_last_booster',
                                    label: 'Date du dernier rappel :',
                                    value: sheet.tetanus_last_booster,
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="h6 mt-4">Allergies</h3>
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'allergic', field_name: 'allergic',
                            type: 'select',
                            label: 'La personne est-elle allergique (aliments, médicaments, etc.) ?',
                            value: sheet.allergic,
                            options: yes_no_options|map(option => option|merge({ selected: option.value == sheet.allergic })),
                        } only %}
                        <div data-reveal-when="allergic=yes">
                            {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                field_id: 'allergies', field_name: 'allergies',
                                type: 'textarea', rows: 2, label: 'Si oui, lesquels ?',
                                value: sheet.allergies,
                            } only %}
                            {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                field_id: 'allergy-consequences', field_name: 'allergy_consequences',
                                type: 'textarea', rows: 2,
                                label: 'Quelles sont les conséquences ?',
                                value: sheet.allergy_consequences,
                            } only %}
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="h6 mt-4">Régime alimentaire</h3>
                        {#
                          No squares on the federation's form for this one, and
                          none is added to it: the question is the same on
                          screen, and « Si oui, lequel ? » is printed on the
                          line that already exists.
                        #}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'follows-diet', field_name: 'follows_diet',
                            type: 'select',
                            label: 'La personne suit-elle un régime alimentaire particulier ?',
                            value: sheet.follows_diet,
                            options: yes_no_options|map(option => option|merge({ selected: option.value == sheet.follows_diet })),
                        } only %}
                        <div data-reveal-when="follows_diet=yes">
                            {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                field_id: 'diet', field_name: 'diet',
                                type: 'textarea', rows: 2, label: 'Si oui, lequel ?',
                                value: sheet.diet,
                            } only %}
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="h6 mt-4">Médicaments</h3>
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'takes-treatment', field_name: 'takes_treatment',
                            type: 'select',
                            label: 'La personne prend-elle un traitement ?',
                            value: sheet.takes_treatment,
                            options: yes_no_options|map(option => option|merge({ selected: option.value == sheet.takes_treatment })),
                        } only %}
                        <div data-reveal-when="takes_treatment=yes">
                            {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                field_id: 'treatment', field_name: 'treatment',
                                type: 'textarea', rows: 3,
                                label: 'Si oui, précisez : nom, dosage, fréquence, indication, mode d\'administration et durée.',
                                value: sheet.treatment,
                            } only %}
                            {# Asked, and printed, only when a treatment is declared. #}
                            {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                field_id: 'treatment-autonomy', field_name: 'treatment_autonomy',
                                type: 'select',
                                label: 'Est-elle autonome dans la prise de ces médicaments ?',
                                value: sheet.treatment_autonomy,
                                options: yes_no_options|map(option => option|merge({ selected: option.value == sheet.treatment_autonomy })),
                            } only %}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row gap-2">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">
                <i class="bi bi-check-lg me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>Enregistrer
            </button>
        </div>
    </form>

    {#
      A form of its own, and a POST rather than a link: everything on this
      document is a child's health, and a GET is what a proxy log, a browser
      history and a `Referer` header keep.

      Outside the form above on purpose — this downloads what was LAST
      SAVED, so mixing the two buttons would suggest that unsaved edits come
      out on the paper. The sentence under the button says so.
    #}
    <form method="post" action="/members/{{ member.memberYearId }}/fiche-sante/pdf" class="mt-3">
        {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-primary">
            <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-pdf me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>Télécharger la fiche à imprimer
        </button>
        <span class="d-block small text-body-secondary mt-1">
            Le formulaire officiel de la fédération, pré-rempli avec ce qui est enregistré ici.
            Enregistrez d'abord si vous venez de modifier quelque chose.
        </span>
    </form>

    {#
      What the PAPER asks, said where a parent looks just before printing
      (issue #1346): these are explanations of the document to complete and
      sign — they create no consent box and no electronic signature, and they
      do not replace this site's own notes on access, encryption and
      retention, which are kept above and in the help.
    #}
    <div class="card mt-3" id="health-sheet-paper-instructions">
        <div class="card-body small">
            <h2 class="h6">Sur le document imprimé</h2>
            <ul class="mb-2">
                <li>Deux emplacements, « Insérez ici une vignette de mutuelle », attendent la vignette de la personne.</li>
                <li>Tout médicament fourni doit être accompagné d'une prescription médicale. Un modèle est disponible sur lesscouts.be.</li>
                <li>Les animateurs et animatrices disposent d'une trousse de secours et peuvent administrer, si nécessaire, du paracétamol, un antiseptique ou une pommade apaisante (sur avis médical ou du pharmacien).</li>
                <li>À signer à la main : « Date et signature du représentant·e légal·e » et « Date et signature de la personne concernée (dès 13 ans) ».</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mb-2">
                Je marque mon accord pour que toute prise en charge et tout soin jugés nécessaires soient mis en œuvre durant le séjour par le ou la responsable du centre de vacances ou par l'équipe médicale. J'autorise le ou la médecin à prendre toute décision urgente indispensable à la santé de la personne concernée, y compris une intervention chirurgicale, si je ne suis pas joignable et, le cas échéant, dans le respect des dispositions légales applicables en matière de consentement.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0">
                J'autorise les animateurs et les animatrices à utiliser la carte d'identité ou la carte ISI+ afin de permettre l'identification en cas de nécessité médicale (consultation, prescription, hospitalisation, etc.).
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    {#
      A separate form: « Tout effacer » destroys data, so it must not be a
      second button inside the form that saves — a stray Enter key would
      otherwise be one keystroke away from it.

      A plain dialog, not the retyped keyword of the Maintenance page: that
      one protects a whole installation, this is a family acting on its own
      data.

      `data-confirm` rather than an inline `onsubmit`: inline handlers are
      dead under this site's CSP, so a `confirm()` written there would not
      ask anything at all — the form would just submit, and the one place
      that must never happen silently is the button that destroys a child's
      health data. `Tests\Core\View\UxConventionsTest` is what says so.
    #}
    <form method="post" action="/members/{{ member.memberYearId }}/fiche-sante/effacer" class="mt-4"
          data-confirm="Effacer définitivement toute la fiche santé de {{ member|display_name }} ? Cette opération ne se défait pas."
          data-confirm-label="Tout effacer">
        {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm">
            <i class="bi bi-trash me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>Tout effacer
        </button>
        <span class="d-block small text-body-secondary mt-1">
            Supprime définitivement du site tout ce que vous avez saisi ici.
        </span>
    </form>
</div>
{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
{# Shows the boxes that depend on an OUI / NON answer, and only those. #}
<script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/health-sheet.js') }}" defer nonce="{{ csp_nonce }}"></script>
{% endblock %}
